{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id622225715"}, "name":{"label":"John Porkerson"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-14T00:14:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"12418308856"}, "title":{"label":"Changed my life 😀"}, "content":{"label":"I was just beating it and then walking down my bedroom when suddenly I busted, realized it was 3:00 AM I thought to myself “I need to stop” but decided to get on the game to get a win? Then suddenly months passed and yet no win or life. I really wanted to fix my addiction, but then suddenly the internet gods came to my house and locked me in the cell for 9 months and made me eat dirt and hold it for it seemed forever  until they grabbed it and told me this “yo touch grass” and made me download this app and boy did my balls burst when I did, as soon as i did I felt a change a change of heart, a change of respect, a whole new era of the world, I could no longer look at my anime internet p as soon as I touched that grass, my depression was cured, my days of beating it and gaming were over, now I have a wife a 9-5 and three kids, thank you for curing my addiction internet gods and the owners of this app", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6739589530&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
